### =============================================================================
###  FIAP Cloud Games — requisições para demonstração manual
###  Visual Studio 2022 (17.12+) · VS Code (extensão REST Client) · Rider
###  Ordem sugerida: 1 → 2 → 4 → 5 → 6 (repita até Approved) → 7 → 8
### =============================================================================
@users = http://localhost:5001
@catalog = http://localhost:5002
@payments = http://localhost:5003
@email = jogador.demo@fcg.local
@password = Senha@123

### 1) Cadastro — publica UserCreatedEvent (veja o e-mail no log do NotificationsAPI)
POST {{users}}/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Jogador Demo", "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 2) Login
# @name login
POST {{users}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{email}}", "password": "{{password}}" }

### 3) Quem sou eu (token decodificado pelo servidor)
GET {{users}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 4) Catálogo (anônimo)
# @name games
GET {{catalog}}/api/games?pageSize=50

### 5) Iniciar compra → 202 Accepted (troque o gameId por um jogo de até R$ 300 para aprovar)
# @name order
POST {{catalog}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "gameId": "{{games.response.body.$.items[0].id}}" }

### 6) Acompanhar o pedido (Pending → Approved | Rejected)
GET {{catalog}}/api/orders/{{order.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 7) Biblioteca
GET {{catalog}}/api/library
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 8) Pagamento do pedido (PaymentsAPI)
GET {{payments}}/api/payments/orders/{{order.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 9) Login do administrador (seed)
# @name admin
POST {{users}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "admin@fcg.local", "password": "Admin@12345" }

### 10) Cadastrar jogo (somente Admin)
POST {{catalog}}/api/games
Authorization: Bearer {{admin.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Jogo Novo", "description": "Cadastrado pelo admin", "genre": "Indie", "price": 49.90, "releaseDate": "2026-10-01" }

### 11) Discovery e JWKS — como Catalog/Payments obtêm a chave pública
GET {{users}}/.well-known/openid-configuration

###
GET {{users}}/.well-known/jwks.json

### 12) Saúde
GET {{catalog}}/health
